{
  "info": {
    "name": "Hospigo 2.1f: template library, terminology, branch modules, starter, dashboard",
    "description": "Step 2.1f. Needs the Hospigo Local environment (baseUrl, staffPassword, superadminPassword, branchAdminPassword, indigoPassword) and the demo seed with the Indigo demo people (SEED_INDIGO_PASSWORD). Cleans up after itself (designs removed, assignment taken away, words cleared).",
